## 📡 API Endpoints

### POST `/api/v1/api/get_second_part/`
Receive the second part of the code.

**Request Example:**
\`\`\`json
{
  "part2IIII		**Response Example:**\`\`\`json{  "part1": "3b6050ea-a3d4-4fc8",  "part2": "-86f4-bec75ca0b0c5",  "part1_plus_part2": "3b6050ea-a3d4-4fc8-86f4-bec75ca0b0c    {      "msg": "Salom",      "status": "success",      "timestamp": "2024-11-08T15:30:00Z"    }  ]}\`\`\`---## 📁 Project Structure\`\`\`.├── api/                 # App with API logic├── config/              # Django settings├── Dockerfile           # Docker configuration├── docker-compose.yml   # Docker Compose setup├── entrypoint.sh        # Container entrypoint script├── MakefileAAADME.md            # This file
